    "RQ-LATE-01"
  ],
  "description": "ENC-PASSWORD (MDB), the protected-first order the earlier probe missed: a new file gets password 'pw-a' by NewPassword on an exclusive read/write open; then NewPassword('pw-a','pw-b') on an exclusive READ-ONLY open with the password; then NewPassword on a SHARED read/write open with the password; each with a marker error before and Errors after; then opens with no password, 'pw-a' and 'pw-b' (counts); then removal NewPassword('pw-a','') on an exclusive read/write open and an open with no password. Asks which open modes admit NewPassword on a protected file.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
